        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Heavy fuel oil, burned in power plant
Emissions, materials use, infrastructure, etc. for oil input to power plants;
UUID: 9cab44e3-c764-32b4-a5d4-7730e6b85c40
All energy use, use of chemicals, emissions to air and water including treatment of flue gasses and effluents.
Location: Estimation for the country.
Technology: Estimation for average technology.
Time period: Some data for 2000 and other elder data for Europe.
Production volume: 0.233 TWh from power plants.
Sampling: Literature and questionnaires 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9cab44e3-c764-32b4-a5d4-7730e6b85c40.xml</text>
